  "description": "OFUXEU crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H64 Dy4 N4 O24,2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.417-3.870 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.01-112.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(H3L)2(OAc)6]·2EtOH (C38H76Dy4N4O26). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
